# 29. CHECK

Some Metasploit modules support:

```text
check
```

`check` attempts to determine whether the target appears vulnerable without performing the full exploit.

Important:

> **Check result ≠ guaranteed exploitation.**

A scanner or check can produce false positives or false negatives.

