# 35. SESSION

When an exploit succeeds and establishes an interactive connection, Metasploit may create a:

> **Session**

Conceptually:

```text
Exploit
 ↓
Payload
 ↓
Session
```

A session allows authorized interaction with the lab target.

---

# 36. SESSION MANAGEMENT

Metasploit provides commands for managing sessions.

A common command is:

```text
