# 39. METERPRETER VS SHELL

### Shell

Usually provides command-line interaction with the target operating system.

### Meterpreter

Provides a richer Metasploit session environment.

| Shell | Meterpreter |
|---|---|
| Basic command interface | Rich session environment |
| OS command interaction | Additional Metasploit functionality |
| Simpler | More feature-rich |

