# 62. EXAM TRAPS

### Trap 1

> "Metasploit = exploit."

Incomplete.

Metasploit is a **framework**.

---

### Trap 2

> "Exploit = payload."

Wrong.

```text
Exploit → triggers vulnerability
Payload → provides functionality
```

---

### Trap 3

> "Successful check = successful exploitation."

Wrong.

```text
Check ≠ Exploit
```

---

### Trap 4

> "Exploit failed = vulnerability doesn't exist."

Wrong.

Other factors may cause failure.

